         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Been a long time.",
          "transl": "Ist 'ne Weile her."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Well, look who's still alive.",
          "transl": "Da brat mir doch einer 'n Storch. Er lebt tatsächlich noch."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Time sure did no harm to you.",
          "transl": "Die Zeit hat dir wohl nicht geschadet."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Been eating my vegetables, is all.",
          "transl": "Hab halt immer mein Gemüse gegessen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "You haven't lost your cheek, either.",
          "transl": "Und deinem Humor anscheinend auch nicht."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "So, what about this lass?",
          "transl": "Also, was is' mit der Kleinen?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "At this point, I'm sure you sent her.",
          "transl": "Jetzt is' mir klar, dass du sie geschickt hast."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "True. Thought the girl might have some trouble convincing you.",
          "transl": "Stimmt. Dachte mir, das Mädchen wird's nicht leicht haben, dich zu überzeugen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Guess I was right.",
          "transl": "Womit ich wohl recht hatte."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I quit the hermit smith life a long time ago, friend.",
          "transl": "Ich hab den Schmiedehammer schon vor langer Zeit an den Nagel gehängt, mein Freund."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "My creations have long been forgotten, or left broken.",
          "transl": "Meine Werke sind schon lange vergessen oder zerbrochen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "She has the drill.",
          "transl": "Sie hat den Bohrer."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "The drill you say? How is that old thing still around?",
          "transl": "Den Bohrer? Das alte Ding? Wie kann das sein?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldsmith",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Can't stop what drives progress.",
          "transl": "Fortschritt lässt sich nun mal nicht aufhalten."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Was in pretty bad shape when I got my hands on it.",
          "transl": "War ziemlich übel dran, als ich ihn in die Hände bekam."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Did what I could. But it needs the stone.",
          "transl": "Hab versucht, was ich konnte, aber er braucht den Stein."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "misc.oldman",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "The stone? And you think this lass can handle it?",
          "transl": "Den Stein? Und du denkst, die Kleine kann ihn kontrollieren?"
